{
  "slug": "localstack",
  "name": "Localstack",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude gains skills for the full LocalStack development workflow — managing the local AWS environment, deploying infrastructure with Terraform/CDK/CloudFormation, debugging failures through log analysis, testing IAM policies before they reach production, saving and restoring environment state, and managing extensions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `iac-deployment` (Deploy infrastructure to LocalStack using IaC tools), `iam-policy-analyzer` (Analyze and enforce IAM policies in LocalStack), `localstack-extensions` (Manage LocalStack Extensions), `localstack-lifecycle` (Manage LocalStack container lifecycle), `logs-analysis` (Analyze LocalStack logs and debug issues), `state-management` (Manage LocalStack state and snapshots)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install localstack@claude-community` from `localstack/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
